{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>Or two days, or a month, or days.</b> A fifth possibility he recounts: during some of these periods they had no leisure to arrange their affairs and those of their flocks, while during others they had already prepared and arranged everything, and then in an instant they would set out, immediately dismantling all their preparations."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:39:08.295580625Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}